text Hold on, we've had this conversation before!
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, have we...?
sound FE7.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Dammit...! What am I supposed to do?
text @[Tomoya]
text Come on, think about it over the Gyuudon.
sound FE8.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Don't you feel even the slightest need to help think of a solution for me?
